  "description": "High-performance, true UI-virtualized Markdown renderer for WPF based on Markdig. Renders Markdown into lightweight WPF blocks inside a VirtualizingStackPanel for smooth scrolling on large documents. Includes a flexible XAML styling system (base + override styles), theming support, and memory-aware image decoding.",
  "id": "MarkdownWPF",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-31T10:39:47.187Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "Eqh1FNL9RQ5p5nxVycmhpExo93K55FTJegSm+ni8FJKsJeNZ+a8k8mw6+ziNcdDwZ2WxU0IRUdaCWlal22bZPw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 52825,
  "published": "2026-05-31T10:37:09.947Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Full Markdown block rendering: headings, paragraphs, code blocks, blockquotes, thematic breaks, lists (ordered/unordered), tables\n\t\t\t- Inline formatting: bold, italic, strikethrough, mark/highlight, code spans, hyperlinks, autolinks, images\n\t\t\t- Subscript (~1) and superscript (^1) rendering with BaselineAlignment\n\t\t\t- Typography replacements: Pandoc symbols ((c), (r), (tm), +-), ellipsis normalization, en/em dashes, punctuation normalization, comma collapse\n\t\t\t- GFM task list support with CheckBox rendering\n\t\t\t- HTML-in-markdown extension: tables, lists, images, links, inline formatting (<b>, <i>, <u>, <s>, <code>)\n\t\t\t- VirtualizingStackPanel with recycling mode for smooth scrolling on large documents\n\t\t\t- Nested scrolling fix: code blocks no longer swallow mouse wheel events; Shift+MouseWheel passes through for horizontal scroll\n\t\t\t- Style system with base+override pattern, Static and Dynamic resource resolution\n\t\t\t- Automatic fallback to Base styles when working style is missing\n\t\t\t- Image caching to avoid redundant network/disk loads on re-render\n\t\t\t- Nested scrolling support (IsScrollViewerEnabled property)\n\t\t\t- Error diagnostics: ResourceLoadFailed event for image and navigation failures\n\t\t\t- Multi-target: net8.0-windows, net472",
